## What's Changed

### Features

* feat: add a project metadata file by @alice in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1543

### Bug fixes

* fix(1510): fix the SCSS import paths in the quick start docs by @bob in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1511
* fix(1514): remove button from html, insert after JS init by @bob in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1515
* fix: Removed unnecessary whitespace within sidemenu. (Theme: classic) by @carol in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1459
* fix: improved accessibility on table headers with a select all checkbox by @carol in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1467
* fix: improved a11y on expando row by @carol in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1468
* fix: Improved a11y on language selector by @carol in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1469
* fix: update and audit dependencies by @alice in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1487
* fix: Enhances relation between button and expanded details row for expando rows by @bob in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1496
* fix: set overrides to fix audit by @alice in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1497
* fix: Improve accessibility of table checkboxes by linking labels and checkboxes and updated cursor type of label by @bob in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1504
* fix: Improved language selector accessibility and added tests by @bob in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1505
* fix: Replaced non-working backticks with <code> and fixes copy button copying an empty string by @bob in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1512
* fix(e2e): unblock the e2e docs build on pnpm 11 by @alice in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1537
* fix(sidemenu): guard nav gap against null by @alice in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1538
* fix(core): skip type checking of dependency declaration files by @bob in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1545
* fix: form control fonts, fieldset spacing and skip link overlay by @bob in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1548
* fix: removes duplicated by @carol in https://github.com/example-org/web-components/pull/1563

